                    {
                        "translation_id": "8df40d18-7421-4902-91bc-5b06797ca1e7",
                        "source_entry_id": "cab3475a-ae52-3c06-8aa2-d1fae09b944f",
                        "source_sense_id": "ff4f2bb0-33fd-3d32-a25f-f3d70a656678",
                        "target_lang_word": "humpie",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "humpie",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e829629-2e20-3ded-8fdb-2dafcb047e63",
                                        "entry_id": "9719c8c2-c222-3c98-ac23-988aec1f3e87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A humpback salmon, Oncorhynchus gorbuscha."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29f93ec3-5422-491b-9a61-9ac148b61dcf",
                                                "sense_id": "2e829629-2e20-3ded-8fdb-2dafcb047e63",
                                                "text": "There was a lot of snagging at first, of humpies too tired to resist, of deadfall trailing limbs in the water, but after a while Gregor caught and by a miracle landed a two-pound rainbow and everyone began fishing in earnest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eee42185-8d53-43ae-82fb-213fc184b26e",
                                                "sense_id": "2e829629-2e20-3ded-8fdb-2dafcb047e63",
                                                "text": "Humpies travel in schools on or near the surface, so the dorsal fin can be easily spotted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24f3bae8-2a16-41d4-bfb3-87ce0696971b",
                                                "sense_id": "2e829629-2e20-3ded-8fdb-2dafcb047e63",
                                                "text": "The once-unthinkable to Hank became his concentrated project for the next several days: to hone his deckwise wife to the mysteries of spotting and capturing humpie salmon from the viewpoint of the wheelhouse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "99a9ff71-8812-4509-934c-bfa747a6238f",
                        "source_entry_id": "cab3475a-ae52-3c06-8aa2-d1fae09b944f",
                        "source_sense_id": "ff4f2bb0-33fd-3d32-a25f-f3d70a656678",
                        "target_lang_word": "горбуша",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "горбуша",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81988df6-6d60-3dde-84e6-9a958f1a13e9",
                                        "entry_id": "476c0ff0-cea9-3ed9-8758-84b7c6dba69d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "вид анадромных промысловых рыб из семейства лососёвых"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9220bd1f-1776-43e1-86cd-d2c3b5ae849e",
                                                "sense_id": "81988df6-6d60-3dde-84e6-9a958f1a13e9",
                                                "text": "Как именно взрослый лосось и его ближайшие «родственники» ― нерка, горбуша, чавыча, кета, кижуч ― находят в безбрежном океане путь в ту единственную речку своего рождения, до сих пор остаётся загадкой."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
